s tas Pepė?","Taip, tai iguana."],"turns":[[0,"¡Buenas tardes!","Good afternoon!","f42cbe7dbf35",1.81],[0,"Hace mucho calor hoy, ¿verdad?","It's very hot today, isn't it?","5f4ef5288a86",2.79],[-1,"Sí, mucho calor.","Yes, very hot.",1],[0,"Aquí, a la sombra, se está mejor.","Here in the shade it's better.","da1508625771",3.95],[0,"¿Conoce a Pepe?","Do you know Pepe?","0910e19eac9f",1.65],[-1,"¿Qué come?","What does he eat?",1],[0,"Flores y fruta. Le gusta el mango.","Flowers and fruit. He likes mango.","757d90f0fd03",5.38],[-1,"No, gracias.","No, thanks.",1],[0,"Es la iguana. Vive en esa piedra.","He's the iguana. He lives on that stone.","bee2a2abff3b",3.23],[0,"Toma el sol todo el día.","He sunbathes all day.","a06bda39c43e",2.99],[0,"Siéntese un rato, si quiere.","Sit for a while, if you like.","10a14d1cc3ef",2.75],[0,"¡Buenas tardes! Pepe y yo seguimos aquí.","Good afternoon! Pepe and I are still here.","003d0b4ebd95",4.65],[-1,"No tanto.","Not that much.",1],[0,"¡Qué suerte! A mí me cansa.","Lucky you! It wears me out.","95ab10ec5d9a",3.36],[-1,"¿Muerde?","Does he bite?",1],[0,"No, no hace nada. Es muy tranquilo.","No, he's harmless. He's very calm.","4eba11eb319d",4.07],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[0,"Entonces ya sabe: es el rey de las ruinas.","Then you know: he's the king of the ruins.","9e138a3c089e",4.57],[-1,"A mí me gusta el calor.","I like the heat.",1],[-1,"No, así estoy bien, gracias.","No, I'm good, thanks.",1],[-1,"¡Sería genial, gracias!","That would be great, thanks!",1],[-1,"¡Claro, gracias!","Sure, thanks!",1],[-1,"No. ¿Quién es Pepe?","No. Who is Pepe?",1],[-1,"Sí, es la iguana.","Yes, he's the iguana.",1]],"contexts":[{"sim":2,"visits":0,"seed":3},{"visits":2,"seed":1},{"sim":1,"visits":0,"seed":2},{"visits":0,"seed":1},{"sim":0,"visits":0,"seed":1},{"visits":1,"seed":2},{"visits":0,"seed":2},{"sim":3,"visits":0,"seed":4},{"visits":1,"seed":1},{"visits":2,"seed":2}],"replies":["heat/0","ask/1","g_yesno/1","heat/1","ask/0","g_yesno/0